I realized what was making me sad

00:03:49.136 --> 00:03:51.970
but I never could have pointed
out at that specific thing

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:55.327
because it was something that
was considered the perception-

00:03:55.327 --> 00:03:58.573
wise by the rest of the world to
be the only thing that I could

00:03:58.573 --> 00:04:00.761
